<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/34/msa@/~part_II__cl_6__subsec_4> <https://schema.org/text> "Meterai perbadanan itu hendaklah disimpan dalam jagaan Pengerusi atau seorang anggota Majlis."@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/34/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/34/msa@/~part_II__cl_6__subsec_5> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/34/msa@/~part_II__cl_6> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/34/msa@> .
