<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/34/msa@/~part_IV__cl_25__subsec_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "3" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/34/msa@> .
