<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/34/msa@/~part_VI__cl_34> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/34/msa@/~part_VI> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/34/msa@> .
