<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/34/msa@/~part_VI__cl_38__subsec_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "3" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/34/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/34/msa@/~part_VI__cl_38__subsec_3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/34/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/34/msa@/~part_VI__cl_38__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "Jika pegawai diberi kuasa menyita dan memeterai apa-apa dokumen, radas atau barang, dia hendaklah memberikan penerimaan yang ditandatangani bagi dokumen, radas atau barang itu."@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/34/msa@> .
