<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/34/msa@/~part_VI__cl_38__subsec_4> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "4" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/34/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/34/msa@/~part_VI__cl_38__subsec_4> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/34/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/34/msa@/~part_VI__cl_38__subsec_4> <https://schema.org/text> "Seseorang pegawai diberi kuasa yang menjalankan kuasa di bawah seksyen ini hendaklah mengemukakan kad kuasanya apabila diminta. Capaian kepada data berkomputer"@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/34/msa@> .
