<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/34/msa@/~part_VI__cl_42__subsec_5> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/34/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/34/msa@/~part_VI__cl_42__subsec_5> <https://schema.org/text> "Apabila mana-mana orang dipertuduh atas mana-mana kesalahan yang berhubungan dengan—"@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/34/msa@> .
